---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'September 12, 2026';
const email = 'zenithjoycloud@gmail.com';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy - ZenithJoyAI"
  description="ZenithJoyAI Privacy Policy: what information this site and our tools collect, how it is used, which third parties are involved, and how to exercise your rights."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-8 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>This policy applies to zenithjoyai.com, operated by ZenithJoyAI, and to the first-party
      content publishing tools we build for our own accounts. Questions may be sent to
      <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline">{email}</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">2. Information we collect</h2>
      <h3 class="font-semibold mt-4 mb-2">2.1 Information you provide</h3>
      <p>If you leave a comment on an article, we store the nickname you enter (optional — blank
      comments are shown as "Anonymous") and the comment text. We do not ask for your email address,
      phone number, or legal name. Only the most recent comments are retained per article.</p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold mt-4 mb-2">2.2 Information collected automatically</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Page counters.</strong> We count <strong>aggregate</strong> views and likes per article to understand which content resonates. These counters do not record your IP address and do not build an individual profile.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> This site may enable Google Analytics (GA4) to understand overall traffic. That service is provided by Google and processes data under its own policies.</li>
        <li><strong>Fonts.</strong> Pages load Google Fonts, so your browser makes a request to Google's servers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="font-semibold mt-4 mb-2">2.3 What we do not collect</h3>
      <p>We do not collect government identification, payment details, or precise location data.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">3. TikTok authorization</h2>
      <p>Our publishing tool uses TikTok's official OAuth flow <strong>solely to publish our own
      content to accounts we own and have authorized</strong>. Specifically:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
        <li>Access tokens returned after authorization are displayed once in the browser and are <strong>not stored by this site</strong>;</li>
        <li>We do not read, collect, or analyze personal data of any other TikTok user;</li>
        <li>We do not sell or share any information obtained through this authorization;</li>
        <li>You may revoke this application's access at any time in your TikTok account settings.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">4. How information is used</h2>
      <p>The information above is used only to display comments and counters, to understand which
      content performs well so we can improve it, and to complete authorization actions you initiate.
      <strong>We do not sell personal information and do not use it for third-party ad targeting.</strong></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">5. Third-party services</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Cloudflare (hosting and data storage)</li>
        <li>Google Analytics and Google Fonts (where enabled)</li>
        <li>TikTok (publishing authorization)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-2">Each operates under its own privacy policy.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may ask us to delete a comment you posted. For any other request to access, correct, or
      delete information relating to you, contact <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline">{email}</a>
      and we will respond within a reasonable period.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">7. Children</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from
      minors. If you believe a minor has provided us information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page
      will change accordingly.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="underline">{email}</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
